     "h": 26.95
    },
    {
     "text": "1. Summary",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 390.13,
     "w": 138.85,
     "h": 33.98
    },
    {
     "text": "Revenue grew 28 percent to 5.4 million, driven by a larger order book for brackets and housings.",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 429.22,
     "w": 862.38,
     "h": 26.95
    },
    {
     "text": "Gross margin held at 78 percent, and operating cash flow was positive in every quarter.",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 459.94,
     "w": 780.36,
     "h": 26.95
    },
    {
     "text": "The company ended the year with 112 employees across two sites, up from 94. Safety incidents",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 510.82,
     "w": 853.98,
     "h": 26.95
    },
    {
     "text": "fell to three recordable cases, none lost-time.",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 542.02,
     "w": 406.91,
     "h": 26.95
    }
   ]
  },
